@baseUrl = http://localhost:5017
@apiKey = replace-with-the-same-api-key-used-by-the-api

### Authorize one file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/authorize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "fileName": "example.txt",
  "contentType": "text/plain",
  "fileSizeBytes": 128
}

### Reject a request without an API key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "example.txt",
  "contentType": "text/plain",
  "fileSizeBytes": 128
}
